# Held on disk, not in git: the data books and data sheets here come from
# bitsavers.org mirrors of 1990-1997 vendor publications, and none of them
# shows redistribution terms (the repository is public).  MANIFEST.md and
# SHA256SUMS list every file with its URL, size and SHA-256; fetch.sh
# fetches them again and checks them.
*.pdf
*.pdf.part
VGADOC_*.TXT
VGADOC_*.TXT.part
